@title Picking a queue for the ingest service

We need a queue that survives a zone outage and costs under $400 a month at today's volume.

data cost = option,monthly; Managed,380; Self-hosted,240; Hosted SaaS,610

cards
### Managed queue (recommended)
Runs in two zones, no patching. **$380** a month at 40M messages.
- 99.95% SLA
- Replays up to 7 days
kpi Monthly cost | $380 | | good

### Self-hosted cluster
Cheapest on paper, but someone owns upgrades and on-call.
- Three brokers across zones
- Upgrades twice a year
!! Needs a named owner before we commit.

### Hosted SaaS
Easiest start; costs grow fastest with volume.
table = item,value; Monthly,$610; Lock-in,high

